# Source of requirements-cpu.txt. Regenerate the hashed pins for the image (linux x86_64, CPython 3.12) with:
#   uv pip compile --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes \
#      --no-strip-extras --emit-index-url --index https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu \
#      --index-strategy unsafe-best-match -o requirements-cpu.txt requirements-cpu.in
# (pip-compile --generate-hashes works too but resolves markers for the host it runs on.)
# torch 2.14.1+cpu (the SAM 2 tracker's runtime, ~1 GB installed) comes from the PyTorch CPU index; sam2 itself is
# installed from requirements-sam2.txt (a hashed GitHub archive of the pinned commit).
